{"pages":[{"h":792,"segs":[["THE CHRISTMAS",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,444.77999999999997,116.00059999999996,80,false],["CONFERENCE",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,390.70000000000005,176.00059999999996,80,false],["VISION AND MISSION",151.90000000000001,167.78059999999994,346.82000000000005,194.10059999999999,20,false],["One of the greatest obstacles to leading a campus",146.40000000000001,225.43489999999986,331.51200000000006,237.8368999999999,9,false],["ministry is the transient nature of the college campus.",146.40000000000001,238.43089999999984,350.40300000000002,250.83289999999988,9,false],["Just as the ministry is beginning to gel and form",146.40000000000001,251.42689999999982,327.96600000000007,263.82889999999986,9,false],["into a real biblical community, the semester ends and",146.40000000000001,264.4228999999998,347.7120000000001,276.82489999999984,9,false],["everyone vacates for an entire month. January feels",146.40000000000001,277.41889999999989,341.44799999999998,289.82089999999988,9,false],["like you’re starting the ministry all over again.",146.40000000000001,290.41489999999988,319.8300000000001,302.81689999999986,9,false],["“We want to see your life changed. We want to see the",370.20299999999997,225.43190000000004,565.88099999999986,237.84289999999999,9,false],["world changed. The Denver Christmas Conference",370.20299999999997,238.42789999999991,556.37699999999973,250.83889999999997,9,false],["(DCC) is a gathering for college students everywhere",370.20299999999997,251.4239,564.702,263.83489999999995,9,false],["to hear from God, to acknowledge our need for Jesus,",370.20299999999997,264.41989999999987,563.29799999999989,276.83089999999993,9,false],["to rebel against injustice, to find healing for our",370.20299999999997,277.41589999999997,544.93799999999987,289.82689999999997,9,false],["brokenness, to obtain freedom from our addictions, to",370.20299999999997,290.41189999999995,566.96100000000001,302.82289999999995,9,false],["get guidance for our future, and to get grounded in the",370.20299999999997,303.40789999999993,569.03999999999996,315.81889999999993,9,false],["Scriptures. It’s a place to explore who we were created",370.20299999999997,316.40389999999991,567.1049999999999,328.81489999999991,9,false],["to be and what we were created to do. Over 1,500 people",370.20299999999997,329.39989999999989,572.1629999999999,341.81089999999989,9,false],["will come together to powerfully pray for God to reveal",370.20299999999997,342.39589999999987,570.06600000000003,354.80689999999987,9,false],["his GLORY to our hearts, our campuses, our cities, and",370.20299999999997,355.39189999999985,572.16300000000001,367.80289999999985,9,false],["our world.”",370.20299999999997,368.38789999999983,410.66700000000003,380.79889999999983,9,false],["But in the world of campus ministry every obstacle is",146.40000000000001,316.41589999999985,347.00100000000009,328.81789999999984,9,false],["at the same time an opportunity, and that opportunity",146.40000000000001,329.41189999999983,349.60200000000009,341.81389999999982,9,false],["is the Christmas Conference. This is a chance to",146.40000000000001,342.40789999999981,328.47900000000016,354.8098999999998,9,false],["gather the most committed members of your ministry",146.40000000000001,355.40389999999979,349.92600000000016,367.80589999999978,9,false],["for five days of the most incredible fellowship,",146.40000000000001,368.39989999999977,320.06400000000002,380.80189999999976,9,false],["worship, Bible teaching, and outreach. In this case",146.40000000000001,381.39589999999976,335.95800000000008,393.79789999999974,9,false],["the Christmas break actually serves to accelerate",146.40000000000001,394.39189999999974,332.20500000000004,406.79389999999972,9,false],["your ministry instead of hinder it. Students return to",146.40000000000001,407.38789999999972,346.12800000000016,419.7898999999997,9,false],["campus ready and eager to lead, to serve, and to reach",146.40000000000001,420.3838999999997,347.8830000000001,432.78589999999969,9,false],["the campus for Christ.",146.40000000000001,433.37989999999968,231.08099999999999,445.78189999999967,9,false],["COMPONENTS OF THE CONFERENCE",370.20000000000005,400.81989999999996,529.20000000000005,421.35989999999998,20,false],["What’s a Christmas Conference like? Here’s how",146.40000000000001,459.38089999999966,330.41399999999999,471.78289999999964,9,false],["the conference team in Indianapolis describes the",146.40000000000001,472.37689999999964,335.69700000000012,484.77889999999962,9,false],["experience:",146.40000000000001,485.37289999999962,190.392,497.7748999999996,9,false],["T H E C H R I S T M A S CO N F E R E N C E 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,636.81050000000005,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,511.43490000000003,150.54000000000002,523.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,550.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,562.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,576.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,588.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,602.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,614.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,628.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,640.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,654.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,666.83690000000001,9,false],["Hanging with 2,000 of your best (or newest)",164.40000000000001,511.43490000000003,330.83700000000005,523.83690000000001,9,false],["friends from colleges in Illinois, Indiana, Ohio,",164.40000000000001,524.43090000000007,340.41300000000012,536.8329,9,false],["and Michigan.",164.40000000000001,537.42689999999993,218.84100000000001,549.82889999999998,9,false],["Learning about God through engaging speakers",164.40000000000001,550.43489999999997,343.33800000000002,562.83690000000001,9,false],["with amazing life stories.",164.40000000000001,563.43090000000007,259.66500000000002,575.8329,9,false],["Connecting with the Lord through group worship",164.40000000000001,576.43489999999997,351.15900000000005,588.83690000000001,9,false],["with a live band.",164.40000000000001,589.43090000000007,226.005,601.8329,9,false],["Sleeping in one of two really sweet hotels (think",164.40000000000001,602.43489999999997,345.56100000000015,614.83690000000001,9,false],["“heavenly beds”…).",164.40000000000001,615.43090000000007,235.48200000000003,627.8329,9,false],["Taking the gospel to the people of Indianapolis",164.40000000000001,628.43489999999997,340.79100000000005,640.83690000000001,9,false],["through the Community Outreach.",164.40000000000001,641.43090000000007,296.09700000000004,653.8329,9,false],["Growing in your relationship with God and",164.40000000000001,654.43489999999997,327.14700000000005,666.83690000000001,9,false],["experiencing true life change!",164.40000000000001,667.43089999999995,277.09799999999996,679.8329,9,false],["The Denver Conference puts it more poetically:",146.40000000000001,693.43190000000004,326.02200000000005,705.83389999999997,9,false],["Besides turning a huge negative (Christmas break)",370.20000000000005,550.43489999999997,561.81000000000017,562.83690000000001,9,false],["into a positive, there are certain elements of the",370.20000000000005,563.43090000000007,550.46100000000024,575.8329,9,false],["Christmas Conference that uniquely contribute to",370.20000000000005,576.42689999999993,560.50500000000011,588.82889999999998,9,false],["the growth and development of the ministry. In fact,",370.20000000000005,589.42290000000003,566.53500000000008,601.82490000000007,9,false],["it would not be inaccurate to say that the Christmas",370.20000000000005,602.41890000000001,565.43700000000013,614.82090000000005,9,false],["Conference (or something just like it) is irreplaceable",370.20000000000005,615.41489999999999,572.70000000000016,627.81690000000003,9,false],["in what it contributes to the development of a true",370.20000000000005,628.41090000000008,559.86600000000021,640.81290000000001,9,false],["biblical community on campus. Here are a few of",370.20000000000005,641.40690000000006,554.27700000000004,653.80889999999999,9,false],["those irreplaceable elements:",370.20000000000005,654.40290000000005,481.77300000000008,666.80490000000009,9,false],["A HEART FOR THE WORLD",370.20000000000005,677.91489999999999,454.48500000000007,693.31989999999996,15,false],["Through stories, videos, speakers, and seminars,",370.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,553.07100000000014,705.83690000000001,9,false],["students are exposed to what God is doing around",370.20000000000005,706.43089999999995,557.76900000000012,718.8329,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"w":612,"ocr":false},{"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["T H E",43.841199999999994,622.86749999999995,57.071199999999997,637.60249999999996,7,false],["C H R I S T M A S",43.841199999999994,576.28949999999998,57.071200000000005,619.89249999999993,7,false],["CO N F E R E N C E 2",43.841200000000001,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,573.31449999999995,9,false],["the world. For many Christians this is the first time",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,340.02600000000012,45.836899999999901,9,false],["they’ll fully grasp and embrace Jesus’ Commission to",146.40000000000001,46.430899999999838,347.35200000000009,58.832899999999881,9,false],["go into the world and “make disciples of all nations.”",146.40000000000001,59.426899999999819,343.25700000000012,71.828899999999862,9,false],["Everything is theory and head-knowledge until it’s",146.40000000000001,72.4228999999998,337.32600000000008,84.824899999999843,9,false],["experienced first-hand. Here, students are exposed",146.40000000000001,85.41889999999978,339.00000000000006,97.820899999999824,9,false],["to the world of missions. The Christmas Conference",146.40000000000001,98.414899999999761,343.959,110.81689999999981,9,false],["can transform a campus ministry into a missionary",146.40000000000001,111.41089999999974,339.99000000000012,123.81289999999979,9,false],["movement as students leave the conference eager to",146.40000000000001,124.40689999999972,343.18500000000006,136.80889999999977,9,false],["return to campus to make an impact for Christ.",146.40000000000001,137.4028999999997,323.9430000000001,149.80489999999975,9,false],["TRAINING",146.40000000000001,160.91489999999999,178.72499999999999,176.31989999999996,15,false],["Besides Bible teaching there is a enormous offering",146.40000000000001,176.43489999999986,340.07100000000003,188.8368999999999,9,false],["of seminars to teach and train in basic ministry skills.",146.40000000000001,189.43089999999984,348.60300000000007,201.83289999999988,9,false],["Students learn how to share their faith, lead a Bible",146.40000000000001,202.42689999999982,339.4860000000001,214.82889999999986,9,false],["study, and disciple other students; they learn how",146.40000000000001,215.4228999999998,333.40200000000004,227.82489999999984,9,false],["to defend their faith, study the Scripture, and lead",146.40000000000001,228.41889999999978,334.48200000000003,240.82089999999982,9,false],["a prayer meeting; they become leaders and laborers",146.40000000000001,241.41489999999976,340.26900000000012,253.81689999999981,9,false],["in the ministry and not just spectators. Here is a",146.40000000000001,254.41089999999974,327.79500000000002,266.81289999999979,9,false],["sampling of just some of the seminars available at one",146.40000000000001,267.40689999999972,349.45800000000008,279.80889999999977,9,false],["Christmas Conference.",146.40000000000001,280.40289999999982,234.68100000000001,292.8048999999998,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,306.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,318.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,319.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,331.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,332.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,344.83689999999996,9,false],["Adventures in Dating",164.40000000000001,306.43489999999997,245.625,318.83689999999996,9,false],["Christ Centered Bible Study",164.40000000000001,319.43489999999997,271.53600000000006,331.83689999999996,9,false],["Christ Centered Life",164.40000000000001,332.43489999999997,242.92500000000001,344.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,345.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,357.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,358.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,370.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,371.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,383.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,396.83689999999996,9,false],["Discovering God’s Will",164.40000000000001,345.43489999999997,251.45700000000005,357.83689999999996,9,false],["Doctrine-Dug Down Deep",164.40000000000001,358.43489999999997,262.98600000000005,370.83689999999996,9,false],["Experiencing God’s Love",164.40000000000001,371.43489999999997,258.89100000000008,383.83689999999996,9,false],["Heart of a Leader",164.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,230.34300000000002,396.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,397.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,409.83689999999996,9,false],["Healthcare Professionals",164.40000000000001,397.43489999999997,260.54700000000003,409.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,410.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,422.83689999999996,9,false],["How to Share Christ",164.40000000000001,410.43489999999997,241.98000000000002,422.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,423.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,435.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,448.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,449.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,461.83689999999996,9,false],["Good news About Injustice",164.40000000000001,423.43489999999997,267.36900000000003,435.83689999999996,9,false],["The Ministry of the Holy Spirit",164.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,282.42600000000004,448.83689999999996,9,false],["I Believe in God",164.40000000000001,449.43489999999997,224.36700000000002,461.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,462.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,474.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,475.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,487.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,488.43490000000003,150.54000000000002,500.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,501.43490000000003,150.54000000000002,513.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,514.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,526.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,527.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,539.83690000000001,9,false],["Theological Women",164.40000000000001,462.43489999999997,241.07100000000003,474.83689999999996,9,false],["Leading A Movement",164.40000000000001,475.43489999999997,246.12900000000002,487.83689999999996,9,false],["Leading a Small Group",164.40000000000001,488.43490000000003,251.04300000000001,500.83690000000001,9,false],["Living a life transformed",164.40000000000001,501.43490000000003,258.55799999999999,513.83690000000001,9,false],["Sharing Christ with your Family",164.40000000000001,514.43489999999997,287.31300000000005,526.83690000000001,9,false],["Transition to the Real World",164.40000000000001,527.43489999999997,273.20100000000002,539.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,540.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,552.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,553.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,565.83690000000001,9,false],["Workplace Ministry",164.40000000000001,540.43489999999997,241.62900000000002,552.83690000000001,9,false],["World Class Discipleship",164.40000000000001,553.43489999999997,260.39400000000001,565.83690000000001,9,false],["VISION",146.40000000000001,576.91489999999999,169.5,592.31989999999996,15,false],["As a minority on campus, Christians can feel isolated,",146.40000000000001,592.43489999999997,349.08900000000006,604.83690000000001,9,false],["irrelevant, and impotent. To be at a conference with",146.40000000000001,605.43090000000007,342.04200000000003,617.8329,9,false],["a thousand or two, fellow believers from colleges and",146.40000000000001,618.42689999999993,345.92100000000005,630.82889999999998,9,false],["universities throughout the country is visionary. You",146.40000000000001,631.42290000000003,345.92100000000005,643.82490000000007,9,false],["feel that you are a part of something bigger than just",146.40000000000001,644.41890000000001,342.60900000000015,656.82090000000005,9,false],["yourself and your campus, and of course you are—",146.40000000000001,657.41489999999999,334.44600000000003,669.81690000000003,9,false],["Christ is building his church everywhere, and on every",146.40000000000001,670.41089999999997,352.16700000000003,682.81290000000001,9,false],["campus. At the Christmas Conference students get a",146.40000000000001,683.40689999999995,344.68800000000005,695.80889999999999,9,false],["glimpse of the larger body of Christ and it is awesome.",146.40000000000001,696.40290000000005,349.92600000000004,708.80489999999998,9,false],["WORSHIP",370.20000000000005,29.595100000000002,402.15000000000003,45.000099999999975,15,false],["To be in a room with a thousand other students",370.20000000000005,45.11509999999987,548.04900000000009,57.517099999999914,9,false],["praising God is to get a taste of heaven, a taste of the",370.20000000000005,58.111099999999851,565.70700000000011,70.513099999999895,9,false],["glory and majesty of God. In the life of Israel there",370.20000000000005,71.107099999999832,558.89400000000023,83.509099999999876,9,false],["were certain times of the year when everyone came",370.20000000000005,84.103099999999813,563.95200000000011,96.505099999999857,9,false],["to the Temple in Jerusalem for this sole purpose. God",370.20000000000005,97.099099999999794,571.98900000000003,109.50109999999984,9,false],["knows that some times we need ‘big;’ the Christmas",370.20000000000005,110.09509999999977,565.42800000000011,122.49709999999982,9,false],["conference provides ‘big.’",370.20000000000005,123.09109999999976,466.55400000000009,135.4930999999998,9,false],["DAY OF OUTREACH",370.20000000000005,146.5951,431.76000000000005,162.00009999999997,15,false],["Unlike a Fall Retreat the Christmas Conference",370.20000000000005,162.11509999999987,550.57800000000009,174.51709999999991,9,false],["has an element of ministry and outreach: a day",370.20000000000005,175.11109999999985,545.92500000000018,187.51309999999989,9,false],["when students put their faith into action out in the",370.20000000000005,188.10709999999983,561.51300000000015,200.50909999999988,9,false],["community. The word of God comes alive in students",370.20000000000005,201.10309999999981,570.93600000000015,213.50509999999986,9,false],["as they go out to help the homeless and needy and",370.20000000000005,214.09909999999979,557.13900000000012,226.50109999999984,9,false],["share Christ with the hopeless. On the evening of",370.20000000000005,227.09509999999977,555.40200000000004,239.49709999999982,9,false],["the Day of Outreach students share stories of the",370.20000000000005,240.09109999999976,554.5920000000001,252.4930999999998,9,false],["amazing and miraculous things they’ve experienced",370.20000000000005,253.08709999999974,566.64300000000003,265.48909999999978,9,false],["as God ministered in and through them. This heart for",370.20000000000005,266.08309999999972,574.52700000000016,278.48509999999976,9,false],["ministry is one of the intangibles students take away",370.20000000000005,279.07909999999981,568.76700000000005,291.4810999999998,9,false],["from the conference and bring back to campus.",370.20000000000005,292.07509999999979,547.33800000000008,304.47709999999978,9,false],["COMMUNITY",370.20000000000005,315.5951,412.86000000000001,331.00009999999997,15,false],["Spending a full, five days together with other",370.20000000000005,331.11509999999998,538.76100000000019,343.51709999999997,9,false],["students from your campus builds those deep cords",370.20000000000005,344.11109999999996,564.66300000000012,356.51309999999995,9,false],["of friendship. This is where your ministry starts to",370.20000000000005,357.10709999999995,561.07200000000023,369.50909999999993,9,false],["become a family: where students truly begin to love",370.20000000000005,370.10309999999993,563.87100000000009,382.50509999999991,9,false],["and care for one another.",370.20000000000005,383.09909999999991,464.07000000000005,395.50109999999989,9,false],["TEACHING",370.20000000000005,406.5951,404.13000000000005,422.00009999999997,15,false],["Not that students don’t get helpful biblical teaching",370.20000000000005,422.11509999999998,564.72600000000011,434.51709999999997,9,false],["and messages back on campus but at the Christmas",370.20000000000005,435.11109999999996,564.13200000000006,447.51309999999995,9,false],["Conference they are exposed some of the most gifted,",370.20000000000005,448.10709999999995,572.80800000000011,460.50909999999993,9,false],["passionate, and knowledgeable communicators of",370.20000000000005,461.10309999999993,559.11000000000013,473.50509999999991,9,false],["the Word. Besides hearing great messages, the more",370.20000000000005,474.09909999999991,566.29200000000014,486.50109999999989,9,false],["important result is that a passion is sparked for God’s",370.20000000000005,487.09509999999989,571.5390000000001,499.49709999999988,9,false],["Word. It is only when someone brings out the full-",370.20000000000005,500.09109999999987,559.14600000000007,512.49309999999991,9,false],["meaning of a Bible passage that you realize how much",370.20000000000005,513.08709999999985,573.00600000000009,525.48909999999978,9,false],["meaning is in there. Students leave with a hunger for",370.20000000000005,526.08309999999983,569.13600000000019,538.48509999999987,9,false],["the Scripture.",370.20000000000005,539.07909999999981,422.73300000000006,551.48109999999986,9,false],["As we’ve said, Christmas Conference builds",370.20000000000005,565.0800999999999,535.57500000000005,577.48209999999983,9,false],["momentum in the ministry at a time that it would",370.20000000000005,578.07609999999977,557.3370000000001,590.47809999999981,9,false],["normally be lost.",370.20000000000005,591.07209999999986,433.38900000000001,603.47409999999991,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]]},{"segs":[["CONFERENCE LOCATIONS AND DATES",146.40000000000001,35.460100000000011,310.46000000000004,56.000099999999975,20,false],["December. Online registration deadline is Dec. 10 in",370.20299999999997,33.345099999999547,564.56700000000001,45.756099999999606,9,false],["order to recieve a discount.",370.20299999999997,46.341099999999528,472.71299999999997,58.743099999999572,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,68.075099999999907,150.54000000000002,80.47709999999995,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,81.075099999999907,150.54000000000002,93.47709999999995,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,94.075099999999907,150.54000000000002,106.47709999999995,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,107.07509999999991,150.54000000000002,119.47709999999995,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,120.07509999999991,150.54000000000002,132.47709999999995,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,133.07509999999991,150.54000000000002,145.47709999999995,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,146.07509999999991,150.54000000000002,158.47709999999995,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,159.07509999999991,150.54000000000002,171.47709999999995,9,false],["•",146.3999,172.07509999999991,150.53989999999999,184.47709999999995,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,185.07509999999991,150.54000000000002,197.47709999999995,9,false],["Boston, MA January 2-6",164.40000000000001,68.075099999999907,259.52100000000002,80.486099999999965,9,false],["Baltimore, MD December 28 - January 1",164.40000000000001,81.075099999999907,317.274,93.486099999999965,9,false],["Greenboro, NC December 28 - January 1",164.40000000000001,94.075099999999907,318.15600000000006,106.48609999999996,9,false],["Atlanta, GA December 29 -January 2",164.40000000000001,107.07509999999991,304.42200000000003,119.48609999999996,9,false],["Indianapolis, IN December 28 - January 1",164.40000000000001,120.07509999999991,322.88100000000003,132.48609999999996,9,false],["Twin Cities, MN December 28 - January 1",164.40000000000001,133.07509999999991,323.97900000000004,145.48609999999996,9,false],["Denver, CO January 2-7",164.40000000000001,146.07509999999991,257.63999999999999,158.48609999999996,9,false],["Ft. Worth, TX January 1-5",164.40000000000001,159.07509999999991,266.23500000000001,171.48609999999996,9,false],["Portland, OR December 28 - January 2",164.3999,172.07509999999991,310.93790000000001,184.48609999999996,9,false],["San Diego, CA December 28 - January 1",164.40000000000001,185.07509999999991,314.34900000000005,197.48609999999996,9,false],["FUND RAISING",370.20000000000005,78.819899999999961,434.10000000000002,99.359899999999925,20,false],["Considering you’ll be staying at five-star hotel for five",370.20000000000005,98.434899999999857,571.89900000000011,110.8368999999999,9,false],["days, the cost of the conference is extrememly cheap.",370.20000000000005,111.43089999999984,570.32400000000007,123.83289999999988,9,false],["That said, it will still run around $200 and most",370.20000000000005,124.42689999999982,550.4430000000001,136.82889999999986,9,false],["students don’t have that kind of money lying around.",370.20000000000005,137.4228999999998,568.47900000000004,149.82489999999984,9,false],["To go to the current Christmas Conference website",146.40000000000001,211.07609999999988,340.10699999999997,223.47809999999993,9,false],["for your region follow this link.",146.40000000000001,224.07209999999986,263.36400000000003,236.47409999999991,9,false],["Therefore finances can be a barrier to students getting",370.20000000000005,163.42389999999978,575.44500000000016,175.82589999999982,9,false],["to the conference. And yet it doesn’t need to be. There",370.20000000000005,176.41989999999976,572.70900000000006,188.8218999999998,9,false],["are some simple things most any student can do to",370.20000000000005,189.41589999999974,560.12700000000018,201.81789999999978,9,false],["garner the money they need to get to the conference.",370.20000000000005,202.41189999999972,567.62400000000014,214.81389999999976,9,false],["For ideas and suggestions, read the article “Raising",370.20000000000005,215.4078999999997,562.87200000000018,227.80989999999974,9,false],["Money for Conferences and Retreats.”",370.20000000000005,228.40389999999968,514.83900000000006,240.80589999999972,9,false],["PROMOTING THE CONFERENCE",146.40000000000001,256.46010000000001,282.91999999999996,277.00009999999997,20,false],["And so it is that the growth of your ministry is to some",146.40000000000001,276.07509999999991,350.78100000000006,288.47709999999995,9,false],["degree tied to how many students attend one of these",146.40000000000001,289.07109999999994,346.72200000000009,301.47309999999993,9,false],["ten regional conferences. To that end it is critical",146.40000000000001,302.06709999999993,331.52100000000013,314.46909999999991,9,false],["as leader to promote and publicize the Christmas",146.40000000000001,315.06309999999991,332.22300000000007,327.46509999999989,9,false],["Conference. Here is a suggested timeline of promotion",146.40000000000001,328.05909999999989,352.18500000000012,340.46109999999987,9,false],["starting in October.",146.40000000000001,341.05509999999987,220.09199999999998,353.45709999999985,9,false],["Mid October. Inform and Educate. Introduce the",146.40000000000001,367.05609999999984,331.36800000000005,379.46709999999985,9,false],["Christmas Conference at your Fall Retreat or weekly",146.40000000000001,380.05209999999983,345.96600000000007,392.45409999999981,9,false],["meeting through a series of skits\/announcements.",146.40000000000001,393.04809999999981,335.94900000000007,405.45009999999979,9,false],["Pass out brochures.",146.40000000000001,406.04409999999979,220.31700000000001,418.44609999999977,9,false],["Late October. Make a banner for your weekly meeting.",146.40000000000001,432.04509999999976,350.52900000000011,444.45609999999976,9,false],["Meet with student leaders. Make a list of all students",146.40000000000001,445.04109999999974,347.46000000000015,457.44309999999973,9,false],["involved in the movement. Agree on goals and prayer",146.40000000000001,458.03709999999973,347.35200000000009,470.43909999999971,9,false],["targets. Plan fund-raisers because you will want to",146.40000000000001,471.03309999999971,338.59500000000014,483.43509999999969,9,false],["start executing these strategies by early November.",146.40000000000001,484.02909999999969,339.315,496.43109999999967,9,false],["Begin to consider transportation issues.",146.40000000000001,497.02509999999967,297.39300000000003,509.42709999999965,9,false],["T H E",43.841199999999994,622.78649999999993,57.071199999999997,637.52150000000006,7,false],["C H R I S T M A S",43.841199999999994,576.20849999999996,57.071200000000005,619.81150000000002,7,false],["CO N F E R E N C E 3",43.841200000000001,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,573.23350000000005,9,false],["Early November. All ministry leaders should be",146.40000000000001,523.02609999999959,325.59900000000005,535.43709999999965,9,false],["registered this week before all-out promotion begins.",146.40000000000001,536.02209999999968,346.91100000000006,548.42409999999961,9,false],["As leaders it’s critical to set an example and essential",146.40000000000001,549.01809999999966,346.38000000000011,561.42009999999959,9,false],["to challenge others to come along. For thoughts on",146.40000000000001,562.01409999999964,336.36300000000017,574.41609999999969,9,false],["how and why to challenge someone to a conference,",146.40000000000001,575.01009999999974,341.21400000000006,587.41209999999967,9,false],["see the article “The Power of an Ask.”",146.40000000000001,588.00609999999961,287.34900000000005,600.40809999999965,9,false],["November. All-out promotion. Testimonies, skits and",146.40000000000001,614.0070999999997,349.48500000000013,626.41809999999964,9,false],["general promotion at your weekly meeting. Banner",146.40000000000001,627.00309999999968,339.97200000000021,639.40509999999972,9,false],["and Sign-up table are also prominant at the meeting.",146.40000000000001,639.99909999999977,344.5440000000001,652.4010999999997,9,false],["Leadership makes sure that every student has either",146.40000000000001,652.99509999999964,344.41800000000012,665.39709999999968,9,false],["been asked or challenged to come to the conference.",146.40000000000001,665.99109999999973,342.46500000000003,678.39309999999966,9,false],["Hold a letter writing party for those students who",146.40000000000001,678.98709999999971,333.798,691.38909999999964,9,false],["need to raise money for the conference.",146.40000000000001,691.98309999999969,295.15200000000004,704.38509999999974,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792}]}